OL,3,GNEWSAHuge delays after lorry crashes
OL,4,Athrough M60 central barrier
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are facing huge delays as part
OL,7,Fof the M60 has been closed in both
OL,8,Fdirections after a lorry crashed
OL,9,Fthrough the central barrier and went on
OL,10,Fto the opposite carriageway.
OL,12,FThe crash happened at junction 15,
OL,13,Fwhere the M60 meets the M61 near
OL,14,FSwinton in Greater Manchester at just
OL,15,Fbefore 07:30 GMT, National Highways
OL,16,Fsaid. It had followed an earlier crash
OL,17,Fin the same area.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
