OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHuge delays after lorry crashes
OL,4,Athrough M60 central barrier
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreater Manchester Police said a heavy
OL,7,Fgoods vehicle hit the central
OL,8,Freservation safety barriers and leaked
OL,9,Ffuel. A spokesperson said no-one was
OL,10,Finjured.
OL,12,FDrivers in the area have been warned of
OL,13,Fdelays of about an hour, with queues
OL,14,Fstretching seven miles (11km).
